- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v5.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v5.png)**: Minimalist vine wrapping a technical circuit infinity loop.
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v6.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v6.png)**: 3D glassmorphic IC-infinity symbol with subtle leafy details.
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v7.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v7.png)**: Fused bio-cybernetic logo, high-end render.
- **[NEW] [evaitec_logo_v8.png](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/assets/logos/evaitec_logo_v8.png)**: Premium dark mode symbol, focus on textures and lighting.

### 3. Verification & Refinement
- Present the generated logos to the user.
- Refine based on feedback (colors, symbolism, typography).

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- View the generated images to ensure they meet the quality and aesthetic standards.
- Check if the colors and symbols match the "Evaitec" brand identity described in [PROJECT_HANDOFF.md](file:///c:/projects/evaitec/PROJECT_HANDOFF.md).
- Ensure the typography is legible and professional.
